## Run 2 — tbard real mode UNDER SUDO (root can read card0 read-only)

card0 is root:video with no ACL for emzmo; emzmo is not in video group.
The read-only scan needs read access to the card node. Under sudo (root),
the scan can read card0 and log its geometry verdict. The oracle holds
card0 master, so try_open_card's acquire_master_lock on card0 will
fail (EACCES — another master exists). The daemon will retry and
never reach render. timeout SIGTERM + kill -KILL if needed.

### Oracle state BEFORE
```
                     USER        PID ACCESS COMMAND
/dev/dri/card0:      nobody      562 F.... tiny-dfr-mbp142
```

